{"synopsis":"Halo musisi terbaik saat itu mengalami kecelakaan lalu lintas dalam perjalanan ke upacara Grammy\nDan ketika dia sadar kembali dia menemukan dirinya berada di tubuh seorang bocah lelaki Korea bernama No Haeil\nDia menemukan dirinya berada dalam keadaan yang benarbenar buruk tempat dan waktu yang berbeda\nDia menegaskan bahwa nama Inggris No Haeil adalah Halo dan merasakan takdir yang kuat Halo yang memasuki Haeil terbukti menjadi seorang jenius musik saat ini juga","alternative_title":"영광의 해일로, The Road to Glory, Glorious Tidal Wave","author":"Beulimseu, Haje","artist":"Beulimseu","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"1a79119e-a117-4d08-b785-d83a0828465f","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"END","date":"2025-03-05","released":"2025-03-05"},{"chapter_id":"b248fb28-0c1f-4bdf-9f93-cf4e3b076e24","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2025-02-27","released":"2025-02-27"},{"chapter_id":"ce4bf4f5-328f-417f-9f04-7bed1e54df7f","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2025-02-27","released":"2025-02-27"},{"chapter_id":"4a0bc4e9-fc8e-4e26-8b96-8c7ff43f327c","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2025-02-12","released":"2025-02-12"},{"chapter_id":"d55f528e-7ff7-44db-a6ca-361ed92ef886","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2025-02-05","released":"2025-02-05"},{"chapter_id":"9b560901-d584-4826-88dc-14ca64cd3037","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"","date":"2025-02-05","released":"2025-02-05"},{"chapter_id":"9bfeb387-5ff7-48ca-a4f2-33ec53593192","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2025-01-22","released":"2025-01-22"},{"chapter_id":"fa881274-50ab-4fb4-a2e4-f5278f57a3d0","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2025-01-22","released":"2025-01-22"},{"chapter_id":"dee84230-cd7a-4643-9569-b1c72438ef9e","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2025-01-08","released":"2025-01-08"},{"chapter_id":"7003003b-237c-4eb5-932a-3e1bb194f74f","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2025-01-08","released":"2025-01-08"},{"ch